# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
# `make build` writes ./disco (Makefile BINARY); `go build ./...` writes ./disco-cli
# (the module name). Both are ~280MB -- ignore each.
disco
disco-cli

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts. Note the narrow patterns:
# a bare `coverage.*` also ignored docs/coverage.md, the generated coverage
# report the ratchet diffs against, so it was never committed.
*.out
coverage.html
coverage.txt
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Distribution binary directory
dist/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
.vscode/

# Sonar scanner output
.scannerwork/

# Claude Code local state
.claude/

focus-group/